actual_result: "Node24 and Node22/npm10 full release:check 301/301, zero skips; zero duplication; Node22 coverage99.63/93.98/100 over4 configured files. Test-first npm10 pack parser fix. Repeated packed real-tracker npm/nativeBun parity185nodes330edges; scratch deleted. Strict health0, prod audit0; full dev audit4high blocked by g8uc. Bot replies recorded, zero unresolved threads, some reviews unavailable/pending."
